Description: Guake-style drop-down terminal emulator for Linux (X11)
 A Guake-style drop-down terminal emulator built with alacritty_terminal and
 gpui. Features tabbed terminals, i18n (English/French), power monitoring,
 screenshots, remote control via QR code, and Wakatime integration.

